---
import Text from '../layouts/Text.astro';
import { contact } from '../data/site';
---

<Text title="Contact" eyebrow="Contact" heading="Say hello." description="How to reach the people behind écho, the private search app for your Mac.">
  <p>Questions about écho, an idea, a bug, or want to know when it’s ready? Write to us:</p>
  <p class="!mt-24 !text-[clamp(1.5rem,1.2rem+1.2vw,2.25rem)] !font-extrabold !tracking-[-0.02em]"><a href={`mailto:${contact.email}`}>{contact.email}</a></p>
  <p class="!mt-24">We read everything and answer as soon as we can.</p>
</Text>
